          "name": "Adyen Cancel an Authorisation Using Your Reference",
          "request": {
            "name": "Adyen Cancel an Authorisation Using Your Reference",
            "description": {
              "content": "This endpoint allows you to cancel a payment if you do not have the PSP reference of the original payment request available.\n\nIn your call, refer to the original payment by using the `reference` that you specified in your payment request.\n\nFor more information, see [Technical cancel](https://docs.adyen.com/online-payments/classic-integrations/modify-payments/cancel#technical-cancel). \n\n> This endpoint is part of our [classic API integration](https://docs.adyen.com/online-payments/classic-integrations/api-integration-ecommerce). If using a [newer integration](https://docs.adyen.com/online-payments), use the [`/cancels`](https://docs.adyen.com/api-explorer/#/CheckoutService/cancels) endpoint under Checkout API instead.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
